-- DECISIVE. Equality widens to [L, L+1ms): here L exists in this zone but L+1ms (02:00:00.000 local) falls in the
-- skipped hour, so the two bounds resolve differently. If the upper bound were converted with a different offset
-- than the lower, the pushed range would invert and prune every file -- and this returns nothing.
SELECT VALUE z.id FROM tzCollBoundary z WHERE z.tsz = datetime("2026-03-08T01:59:59.999");
